# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_cloister_of_flames, CloisterOfFlames): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Fire_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event).
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/Fire_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger FP_Entrance                     # the resonator: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                  # area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Fire_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Fire_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
